     - - INT-059 Secure Boot: guest reports `Secure Boot: disabled (unsupported)`. This OVMF is plain
     -   OVMF_CODE.fd -- Secure Boot rehearsal needs the `OVMF_CODE.secboot.fd` variant wired in.
