     - ## The Problem
     - THE CASE IS ALREADY MADE, BY USE RATHER THAN BY ARGUMENT. FSH_SPINE_TRACE is a bare eprintln behind
     - an env-var check -- four lines -- and it was the decisive tool twice in one week. It proved the router
