     -
     - ### 1. A COMPLETED INTENT IS HISTORY. DO NOT REWRITE IT.
     -
     - When `faelight-fm` and `faelight-glog` were retired, tWENTY-FOUR intents mentioned them.
     - Only THREE needed touching:
